        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gaarí an umér tlahh'aá Israeli nee yaamuudá' kay qasiís. Digmuú yaamu oo iimír bihhaá /iiko nina Hetiloni wa tláy ay ti'inángw gixsár Hamati, iri kumiít ay Hasar-enoni, tidár digmuú Damaskoro bihhaá /iikwí dirii', nee iri kumiít iimír bihhaá da/aáw wá tleemu ay bihhaá /uwa. Yaamuuká' a yaamaá tlahhoó Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá digmuuwo ti hará' nee awa Dani bihhaá da/aáw ay bihhaá /uwa a yaamaá Asheri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlahhoó Naftali yaamuuín dír kiwa sleera' a bihhaá yaamaá Asheri bihhaá da/aáw wá tleemu ay bihhaá /uwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá yaamaá tlahhoó Naftaliwo, daqaní tlahhoó Manase yaamu ngi slay, iimír bihhaá da/aáw wá tleemu ay bihhaá /uwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuudá' ti hará' nee yaamaá Manase iimír bihhaá da/aáw wa tleemu ay bihhaá /uwa. Yaamuuká' awa tlahhoó Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá nee tlahhoó Efraimu digma, iimír bihhaá da/aáw ay bihhaá /uwa, yaamuuká' awa tlahhoó Reubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá nee yaamaá tlahhoó Reubeni ti hara' iimír bihhaá da/aáw ay bihhaá /uwa a yaamaá tlahhoó Yuda.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Alaá yaamaá tlahhoó Yudawo yaamaá tlenaango kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee uroó bihheero kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár, ki qasisá' iimír bihhaá /iya ay basa, nee tlenaangw aqo adoodá' iimír bihhaá da/aáw wá tleemu ay bihhaá /uwa. Yaamuuká' i alqoná' nee yaamaá tlahh'i sleémeero. Dír hotaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ka tlehhá' tla/ángw yaamuuká'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Yaamaá taa dimbeé paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tlenaangós a kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee tlaqi nee bihheerós a kilomiíta mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér Mungú yaamuuín ngi sleer baraá yaamuuká' wa ale. Yaamuuká' tlenangw'ín a kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee tlaqi iimír bihhaá da/aáw ay bihhaá /uwawo, kilomiíta kooán iimír bihhaá /iiko ay bihhaá basa. Dír hotaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ka tlehhá' tla/ángw yaamuuká'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá yaamuuká' hhoohhooe kaahamuusér Mungú, tidár Sadoki, dir'ín ngi slaye', kudá' aníng iga sagadiyusiye' ar inkihhimu qoomár múk Iraeli iwa dee/anuút, adoodá' sleeme múk tlahhoó Laáwi aa tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuká' an yaamuuín kudá' taa tsawaár dír yaamaá hhoohhooe, kudá' ak ló'wa hhoohhoo', kudá' nee yaamaá tlahhoó Laáwi taa hariye'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá Laáwi a yaamuudá' awa bihhaá basa, dír yaamaá kaahamuusér Munguhe. Tlenaango yaamuuká' a kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee tlaqi iimír bihhaá da/aáw wá tleemu ay bihhaá /uwa. Uroó bihheerós a kilomiíta kooán iimír bihhaá /iíkwá tleemu ay bihhaá basa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamu ki baloó weerisiiká nee ki qasisiiká tam dír hee gaalá, asma yaamuuká' an yaamaá hhoohhoo' nee awa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, an yaamaá hhoo' ta ak yaamu sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Yaamuudá' taa tsawaár naa meetiye' tlenaango a kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee tlaqi nee uroó bihheero kilomiíta tsár nee tlaqi, yaamuuká' gadiyér alhotaari ar gixsa, nee yaamaá hota nee dír qamu. Baraá tla/ángw yaamuudae gixsa ka tleehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuká' masók bihheero i alqoná' umuú bihhiiwo a miíta kume tsár nee tsiire tsár nee mibeeri kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá gixsa ngaa harweeriye' awa intlaxweemawo miíta tsiiruú wák nee mibeeri tsár nee kooán meetisaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá naa meetiye' alaá Doó Mungú tleehharo burkwa hhe'eés, bihhaá basa awa gixsaro tlenaangw kilomiíta tsár nee tlaqi, bihhaá da/aawe kilomiíta kooán, nee bihheero kilomiíta tsár nee tlaqi, nee bihhaá /uwawo, yaamuuká' awa dosluuse nee awa yaamuloouusér baraá gixsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heé baraá gixsár wa hoota tam oo tlahhay gaalá, yaamuudá' ki doosli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe yaamuudá' sleémeero taa tsawaár, didá' hhoohhoo' dinkwa nee yaamaá gixsa, bihheero sleémeero i alqón a kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee tlaqi umuú bihhiiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Yaamuudá' naa meetiye' bihhe sleémeerowo awa yaamuudá' hhoohhoo' nee kudaá gixsa, yaamuudá' sleémeero i alqoná', tlenaango a kilomiíta mibaá nee tsár nee tlaqi bihhe sleémeerowo, iimír bihhaá da/aáw wá tleemu ay /uwa. Yaamuudá' ti ga/aawá' nee yaamuudá' ta tlahh'ií qasiís a yaamaá geeraharusmo. Yaamuudá' hhoohhoo' handá' Doó Mungú i baraá tla/angwdá', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee yaamaá tlahhoó Laáwi dinkwa nee yaamaá gixsa in baraá tla/ángw yaamuudaá geeraharusmo. Yaamaá geeraharusmo a digma nee yaamaá tlahhoó Yuda, nee awa tlahhoó Benyamini.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tlahh'iidaá hatlá' naa meetiye' yaamuuín ki adoorí qasís. Tlahhoó Benyamini yaamu ngi slayá' iimír bihhaá da/aáw ay bihhaá /uwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala yaamaá tlahhoó Benyamini a digma nee yaamaá tlahhoó Simeon, iimír bihhaá da/aáw ay bihhaá /uwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
